Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:02:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: F-219 - local-process module runner (no Docker)

- manifest: optional process.command (file in the module dir or a program on PATH),
  mutually exclusive with compose; compose validation split out
- ProcessRunner: child process in its own process group, socket env rewritten from
  /run/agent-wow to the real SocketDir, output to <SocketDir>/module.log, Down = SIGTERM
  then SIGKILL after 5 s
- AutoRunner (new default): process.command -> ProcessRunner, else ComposeRunner
- verified live: fixture module run as a process received pushed packets, called the
  session clock back and exited on logout

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
